# DOMAIN-SUFFIX matches the root domain and all subdomains.
# No policy names, [Rule] sections, IP ranges or MITM requirements.
# Sources and scope: claude/README.md
# Community source: https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community/blob/master/data/anthropic
# Official network requirements: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config

# 1. Core: web, mobile/desktop app service domains, API, authentication, console, assets.
# Covers api.anthropic.com, platform.claude.com, sso.claude.com,
# assets-proxy.anthropic.com, mcp-proxy.anthropic.com, downloads.claude.ai.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com

# 2. User content, Artifacts, browser bridge and MCP app components.
# Covers bridge.claudeusercontent.com and *.frame.claudeusercontent.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudepages.dev

# 3. Additional domains listed by the community Anthropic ruleset.
